## R7 proof, §8 check 2: acnesphere_x1.rib's scene scaled x0.001 -- radius,
## camera distance and Clipping all scale together, so this must render
## the same image as acnesphere_x1.rib once self-shadow acne is
## scale-independent. This overrides AGENTS.md's default camera and
## Clipping for this fixture, on r5b_quadrics.rib's own precedent. Not
## third-party.
Display "acnesphere_xsmall.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 400 400 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.0005 0.05
Translate 0 0 0.005
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.2] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [1 1 -5] "to" [0 0 0]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0.3] "Kd" [0.9]
Sphere 0.001 -0.001 0.001 360
WorldEnd
